       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-04 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Education Ministry Launches Rs 5.4 Crore Innovation Challenge</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education Ministry</span> <span>#Innovation Challenge</span> <span>#Funding</span> <span>#India Education</span></div>
       <p>The Education Ministry has launched a challenge offering Rs 5.4 crore for innovative ideas, as reported by India Today. This initiative aims to foster creativity and new solutions within the education sector and beyond.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/education-ministry-launches-rs-54-crore-innovation-challenge.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Individuals with innovative ideas are encouraged to apply for this significant challenge. The substantial funding highlights the Ministry's commitment to supporting groundbreaking concepts and nurturing an environment of innovation.</p><p>What to watch: Details on application process and eligibility for the challenge.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
