       <h1>Kieran Culkin expresses interest in returning as Devil on 'Family Guy'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kieran Culkin has expressed a strong desire to reprise his role as the Devil on the animated series &quot;Family Guy.&quot; Culkin, who reportedly enjoyed his time working on the show, proved to be a highly collaborative and enthusiastic guest star.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/kieran-culkin-expresses-interest-in-returning-as-devil-on-fa.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The production team noted that Culkin was fully committed to the role and insisted on being invited back for future appearances. His positive experience during the recording process has paved the way for potential future collaborations involving his character, should the show's writers decide to revisit the Devil in upcoming episodes.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the source's reporting on Culkin's interest in reprising his voice role.</p>
