     <article class="story single" data-beat="defence">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">DEFENCE</span> · Defence (aggregate) · 2026-10-04 · editor 8/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Mahindra-Embraer Select Nagpur for C-390 Assembly</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Defence</span> <span>#Aerospace</span> <span>#India</span></div>
       <p>Mahindra Group and Brazilian aerospace firm Embraer have reportedly identified Nagpur as the location for the assembly of their C-390 Millennium multi-mission aircraft. This strategic decision is being made with a clear focus on the upcoming Indian Air Force (IAF) medium transport aircraft deal, according to ThePrint.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/mahindra-embraer-select-nagpur-for-c-390-assembly.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The selection of Nagpur indicates a significant step in the companies' joint efforts to position the C-390 as a contender for the IAF's procurement requirements. The C-390 Millennium is a tactical military transport aircraft designed for various missions.</p><p>This development suggests a potential boost for India's indigenous aerospace manufacturing capabilities should the joint venture secure the IAF contract. The proposed assembly facility in Nagpur would contribute to local production and skill development.</p><p>What to watch: Further details on the IAF's medium transport aircraft deal are anticipated.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately conveys the core information from the source summary. It is concise and covers the key entities and the strategic goal involved.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" rel="noopener">Defence (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/nagpur/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nagpur</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-04/mahindra-embraer-select-nagpur-for-c-390-assembly" data-title="Mahindra-Embraer Select Nagpur for C-390 Assembly"><b>Share:</b>
