       <h1>Rekha Bhardwaj Sings ‘Shayad’ for Main Na Raha Mera</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>T-Series has released ‘Shayad’, a new romantic track from the upcoming film Main Na Raha Mera. The song, composed by Rahul Nair with lyrics by Dev Pandey, features vocals by Rekha Bhardwaj and stars Adhyayan Suman and Divita Rai. It aims to capture unspoken emotions of vulnerability and longing through an intimate musical arrangement.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/rekha-bhardwaj-sings-shayad-for-main-na-raha-mera.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Amit Kasaria and produced by Dharmesh Sangani, the project explores complex relationship dynamics. Rekha Bhardwaj noted the song’s simplicity and emotional honesty, while Suman expressed hope that audiences would connect with the track. The song is available on streaming platforms, with its music video featured on the T-Series YouTube channel.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and includes all relevant production and cast details provided in the source.</p>
