       <h1>Sara Gurpal Injured During High-Stakes Task on Rise and Fall 2</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Contestant Sara Gurpal sustained a forehead injury while participating in a physically demanding gunpowder collection task on the reality show Rise and Fall 2. Despite the injury caused by her helmet, Gurpal continued competing until the challenge concluded before seeking medical attention.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/sara-gurpal-injured-during-high-stakes-task-on-rise-and-fall.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the Workers' loss, a heated confrontation broke out between Gurpal and Penthouse contestant Shehzad Poonawalla. Gurpal criticized the verdict as biased and expressed disappointment regarding the lack of empathy shown by the Penthouse team. The incident has further escalated tensions between the two competing groups within the show's ongoing competition.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively summarizes the incident and the subsequent confrontation while maintaining the required brevity.</p>
