<!doctype html><html lang="en" data-theme="dark"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Tesla Introduces Emergency Drive-Away Feature for Superchargers in US — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="Tesla has introduced a new Emergency Drive Away feature designed to allow drivers to disengage their vehicles from a Supercharger and drive away even ">
