       <h1>UFC Fighter Bobby Green Targets Historic 2026 Win Streak</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>UFC lightweight Bobby Green, 40, is on a four-fight win streak heading into his UFC 332 bout against Esteban Ribovics in Salt Lake City. Victory would mark his fourth win of 2026, putting him one win away from a rare five-win calendar year.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/ufc-fighter-bobby-green-targets-historic-2026-win-streak.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Despite his success, Green recently revealed he has been living out of his car after prioritizing family and friends with his earnings. Green clarified he is homeless but not without housing, as he continues to focus on changing his family's life through his fighting career.</p>
