       <h1>WB NEET UG 2026 counselling round 3 choice filling opens</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#NEET UG</span> <span>#West Bengal</span></div>
       <p>The West Bengal NEET UG 2026 counselling process has entered its third round, with the choice filling window now officially open for eligible candidates. This phase is critical for students seeking admission to undergraduate medical courses within the state.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-04/wb-neet-ug-2026-counselling-round-3-choice-filling-opens.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the completion of the choice filling process, the official seat allotment results are scheduled to be released on October 8, 2026. Candidates are advised to monitor the official portal for updates regarding their application status.</p><p>What to watch: October 8 seat allotment results.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft effectively summarizes the key dates and status of the WB NEET UG 2026 counselling process.</p>
